; Caulder, sketch C "Mad Waltz": A minor, 3/4, 94 bpm. A low horn sings a chromatic waltz hook over plucked bass, harp chords on beats 2 and 3 and a string counterline; timpani on every first beat. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
